  "mermaidCatalogTemplateFlowchart": "graph TD\n  A[Début]\n  B[Étape de traitement]\n  C<MERMAID_OPEN_BRACE>Condition<MERMAID_CLOSE_BRACE>\n  D[Fin]\n\n  A --> B\n  B --> C\n  C -->|Oui| D\n  C -->|Non| B",
